OL,3,APolls close as voters in Alberta decide
OL,4,Awhether to have referendum on leaving
OL,5,ACanada
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, indigenous Albertans have
OL,8,Fbeen working to block the vote for
OL,9,Fmonths, arguing separation would
OL,10,Fviolate land treaties
OL,12,FWhat happens next? If a majority vote
OL,13,Ffor independence, it would kick-start
OL,14,Fthe process of holding a binding
OL,15,Freferendum on separation
